     The memory area used for the _D_w_a_r_f___A_b_b_r_e_v descriptor returned in argument
     _r_e_t___a_b_b_r_e_v is allocated by the DWARF Access Library (libdwarf, -ldwarf).
     Application code should use function ddwwaarrff__ddeeaalllloocc() with the allocation
     type DW_DLA_ABBREV to free the memory area when the _D_w_a_r_f___A_b_b_r_e_v descrip‐
